#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:3
#: 51ccffae89484ddda6dd028a1bdc1c86
msgid "磁序（Magnetic Order）"
msgstr "Magnetic Order"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:5
#: f46b708f06b84a96b1ed659c98c8da9e
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:7
#: 7964749823f84189b7851b9eb52c9a5b
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:9
#: 779e585bcc544989bbceeb3a93215464
msgid ""
"根据元素磁矩幅值，从每个输入结构生成 FM、AFM 和随机 PM 初始自旋构型。卡片不改变原子坐标、元素或晶胞；输出统一写入三分量 `spin:R:3`，并同步维护 "
"ASE `initial_magmoms`。"
msgstr ""
"Use element magnetic-moment magnitudes to generate FM, AFM, and random PM initial "
"spin configurations for each input. The card does not change coordinates, elements, "
"or the cell; outputs consistently write three-component `spin:R:3` values and update "
"ASE `initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:11
#: 82d50b27df7b4fef80be983cbc041aba
msgid ""
"这张卡生成的是用于 DFT/NEP 数据准备的**初始自旋端点**，不是磁基态判断器，也不能证明某个输出是真正的热力学 FM、AFM 或 PM "
"相。后续仍需通过电子结构计算、能量比较和收敛后磁矩验证。"
msgstr ""
"This card generates **initial spin endpoints** for DFT/NEP data preparation. It is "
"not a magnetic-ground-state classifier and cannot prove that an output is a "
"thermodynamic FM, AFM, or PM phase. Verify it later with electronic-structure "
"calculations, energy comparisons, and converged magnetic moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:13
#: 327d95db60b2499cafa336e79333dc73
msgid "`Magnetic Order` 与 `Moment Disorder` 的职责不同："
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` and `Moment Disorder` have different roles:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:15
#: 327d95db60b2499cafa336e79333dc73
msgid "`Magnetic Order`：建立 FM、AFM 或完全随机 PM 端点。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order`: create FM, AFM, or fully random PM endpoints."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:16
#: 07e7bcd06015400fb33b1447b19b8b43
msgid "`Moment Disorder`：从已有磁态出发，按比例翻转或重新定向一部分磁矩，生成不同无序程度的中间状态。"
msgstr ""
"`Moment Disorder`: start from an existing magnetic state and flip or reorient a "
"fraction of its moments to generate intermediate states with different degrees of "
"disorder."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:18
#: ddbed606eaa5456d9f65f5298eff1760
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:20
#: db586c1028484d0f8b6b5657c112071c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"程序先为每个原子得到磁矩模长 $m_i$。共线输出写入标量 $m_i s_i$，非共线输出沿参考轴 $\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ 写入 $\\mathbf "
"m_i=m_i s_i\\hat{\\mathbf a}$。三类磁序的符号/方向规则为："
msgstr ""
"The program first obtains a moment magnitude $m_i$ for each atom. Collinear outputs "
"use the scalar $m_i s_i$; non-collinear outputs use $\\mathbf m_i=m_i "
"s_i\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ along the reference axis $\\hat{\\mathbf a}$. The sign and "
"direction rules for the three orders are:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:24
#: 45276532526943a08a9cd9ffdae40613
msgid "铁磁（FM）：所有磁性原子 $s_i=+1$；"
msgstr "Ferromagnetic (FM): every magnetic atom has $s_i=+1$;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:25
#: 10b0d053a57f45e8b96de31244c36266
msgid "反铁磁（AFM）：按 k 向量层号或 A/B 分组交替给出 $s_i=\\pm1$；"
msgstr "Antiferromagnetic (AFM): alternate $s_i=\\pm1$ by k-vector layer index or A/B groups;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:26
#: 60b44d648b834fc786fafa77ca8d1573
msgid "顺磁近似（PM）：共线模式随机取正负号，非共线模式按球面、圆锥、平面或轴向规则抽方向。"
msgstr ""
"Paramagnetic approximation (PM): choose random signs in collinear mode, or sample "
"directions on a sphere, cone, plane, or axis in non-collinear mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:28
#: 7fb61157ceba49929d306a729be87865
msgid "`平衡正负磁矩`只约束有限样本中的正负数量尽量相等，不等价于热力学顺磁系综；这张卡生成 的是用于训练覆盖的磁构型快照，不是在求磁性基态。"
msgstr ""
"`Balance positive and negative moments` only makes the sign counts as equal as "
"possible in a finite sample; it is not a thermodynamic paramagnetic ensemble. This "
"card generates magnetic snapshots for training coverage, not a magnetic ground state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:31
#: b09833a9cd1149bca550c12bb949ba8e
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:33
#: dfc615351db649c88f54b6cd860fa320
msgid "场景：BCC Fe 模型只见过 FM，AFM 测试误差明显更高"
msgstr "Scenario: a BCC Fe model has seen only FM states and has much higher AFM test error"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:35
#: da1fec2d927644f0b56896aa3ab8eb07
msgid ""
"训练集中的 BCC Fe 全是 FM 初态，模型在分层 AFM 构型上的能量和磁力误差显著增大。需要对同一批几何结构补充 FM、AFM 和随机 PM "
"自旋端点，分离“几何覆盖不足”和“磁环境覆盖不足”。"
msgstr ""
"All BCC Fe structures in the training set are FM initial states, and energy and "
"magnetic-force errors increase sharply for layered AFM configurations. Add FM, AFM, "
"and random PM spin endpoints for the same geometries to separate insufficient "
"geometric coverage from insufficient magnetic-environment coverage."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:37
#: 583ed484912146d8853e7d6629b3b058
msgid "**输入：** 2×2×2 BCC Fe 周期超胞。"
msgstr "**Input:** a 2×2×2 periodic BCC Fe supercell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:39
#: 80fbc30f19574049b90c07588553db70
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:41
#: 8c9838686cb64f848fbc4047c9329f4e
msgid "`自旋模型`（`format`） = `collinear`"
msgstr "`Spin model` (`format`) = `collinear`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:42
#: 0e9e5ee345d94be0b55be6baf5793b31
msgid "`参考轴`（`axis`） = `[0, 0, 1]`"
msgstr "`Reference axis` (`axis`) = `[0, 0, 1]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:43
#: a02fe6a401c94d33acf46b13e968a23e
msgid "`Element moments` = `Fe:2.2`"
msgstr "`Element moments` = `Fe:2.2`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:44
#: 8dc816432b1d4603854a19fbde429f7b
msgid "开启 FM、AFM 和 PM"
msgstr "Enable FM, AFM, and PM"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:45
#: cddafdbdfa7e4c2c90accbb51ef52099
msgid "`AFM 分配方式`（`afm_mode`） = `k_vector`"
msgstr "`AFM assignment mode` (`afm_mode`) = `k_vector`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:46
#: 4227cf09d9ed4a5e95aebd13d927390e
msgid "`AFM 层向量`（`afm_kvec`） = `111`"
msgstr "`AFM layer vector` (`afm_kvec`) = `111`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:47
#: f83992fd679142ca89759ebaf8e95f16
msgid "`PM structures per input` = `8`"
msgstr "`PM structures per input` = `8`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:48
#: c8826b3a5f9b4a6b8ce6fda362361a6a
msgid "开启`使用随机种子`并把`随机种子`设为 `42`"
msgstr "Enable `Use seed` and set `Seed` to `42`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:50
#: b556842ad4bb404fb4c72ebedf063a1f
msgid ""
"**运行前检查：** 首输入预览应显示 16 个磁性原子、AFM `+8/-8`，并给出每个输入及整个数据集的预计输出数量。如果 AFM 只有一个符号，先扩胞或更换 "
"layer vector。"
msgstr ""
"**Before running:** the first-input preview should show 16 magnetic atoms, AFM "
"`+8/-8`, and estimated output counts per input and for the dataset. If AFM has only "
"one sign, expand the cell or change the layer vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:52
#: 72da80c7c6e2414b9a237bd27d7c99f7
msgid "**输出：** 每个输入生成 1 个 FM、1 个 AFM 和 8 个随机 PM，共 10 个结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** each input produces one FM, one AFM, and eight random PM structures, for "
"ten structures total."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:54
#: 50e6326d8d02450394df66e5345f14a4
msgid "**验证改善：**"
msgstr "**Validate the improvement:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:56
#: d030efb4dd2b4bb785f5a877eb261fe7
msgid "检查 FM 自旋沿参考轴同向，AFM 同时包含正负号。"
msgstr "Check that FM spins align along the reference axis and AFM contains both signs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:57
#: 18d95f4faa8e4fc78367773e3d2c29fc
msgid "固定 seed 后重复运行，PM 自旋应逐帧一致。"
msgstr "Repeat the run with a fixed seed; PM spins should match frame by frame."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:58
#: 209b501e89214f3a8c9fd652466bc0de
msgid "重训后分别比较 FM、AFM 和随机 PM 测试切片，不能只看混合总 RMSE。"
msgstr ""
"After retraining, compare FM, AFM, and random-PM test slices separately; do not rely "
"only on the mixed overall RMSE."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:60
#: 0a5a4b01bb514ebab782629965796bb8
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:62
#: f058bf96084e47db9f861ae4803e224e
msgid "自旋模型和磁矩幅值"
msgstr "Spin model and moment magnitudes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:64
#: 890c3d33e40d4b589a4cb9c438761125
msgid "自旋模型（format）"
msgstr "format"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:66
#: 7825ca47927142288bc9bcd1e91badd0
msgid "`str`，默认 `collinear`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `collinear`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:68
#: 68406085a00d45d296f58f292fd96112
msgid "`collinear`：所有输出沿参考轴，只改变正负符号。"
msgstr "`collinear`: all outputs lie along the reference axis; only the sign changes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:69
#: 929ca09a6279422498c5cbba7cfee432
msgid "`noncollinear`：FM/AFM 可使用三维参考方向，PM 可在球面、锥面、平面或参考轴上取向。"
msgstr ""
"`noncollinear`: FM/AFM may use a three-dimensional reference direction; PM may orient"
" on a sphere, cone, plane, or reference axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:71
#: 6c607eb2ca0b40a09eb1580d282be77b
msgid ""
"旧项目中的 `Collinear (scalar)` 和 `Non-collinear (vector)` "
"会继续读取。这里的“模型”描述允许的自旋方向，不是文件格式；导出的规范字段始终是 `spin:R:3`。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy `Collinear (scalar)` and `Non-collinear (vector)` values remain readable. Here"
" `model` describes allowed spin directions, not the file format; the canonical "
"exported field is always `spin:R:3`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:73
#: 8d3c6184e01a4035a60cabb02ae20778
msgid "参考轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:75
#: 138639a0bf4642d0a286eff60d47babc
msgid "`[x, y, z]`，默认 `[0, 0, 1]`。必须是有限的非零三分量向量。程序内部会归一化："
msgstr ""
"`[x, y, z]`, default `[0, 0, 1]`. It must be a finite, nonzero three-component "
"vector. The program normalizes it internally:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:77
#: 83356c784dbd4629ab0a946cbbc2882c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "共线 FM/AFM/PM 使用 $\\pm\\hat{\\mathbf a}$。"
msgstr "Collinear FM/AFM/PM use $\\pm\\hat{\\mathbf a}$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:78
#: e226e9912a8a468fb7a436d51b37a9d8
msgid "非共线 FM/AFM 默认以它为方向。"
msgstr "Non-collinear FM/AFM use it as the default direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:79
#: a5492b9e9e934a239540948fbe1f141d
msgid "非共线 PM 的 cone、plane 和 axis 分布以它为参考。"
msgstr "The cone, plane, and axis distributions for non-collinear PM use it as the reference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:81
#: 97c1f2e56ed04a51b4476416b0676f55
msgid "元素磁矩（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:83
#: a6d2b68eea374ea28e4f1bc8249dafff
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`str`，默认空。界面使用“元素 / 磁矩模长”表格，单位为 $\\mu_\\mathrm{B}$；序列化仍使用逐元素映射："
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. The interface uses an `Element / Moment magnitude` table in "
"$\\mu_\\mathrm{B}$; serialization continues to use a per-element mapping:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:85
#: 195456da92af493991dba27fba11ab0e
msgid "Fe:2.2,Co:1.7,Ni:0.6\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:89
#: c3933de38dd4407a99e7876b3ccce451
msgid "非共线模式也接受向量值；向量的模长同时决定磁矩大小："
msgstr ""
"Non-collinear mode also accepts vector values; the vector norm determines the moment "
"magnitude:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:91
#: 81fe46bb0a7546dba4da47b2fe62fd5f
msgid "Fe:[0,0,2.2],Cr:[0,0,-1.5]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:95
#: 0419d38c074545499cc216dad7ce7276
msgid "也可使用 JSON："
msgstr "JSON is also accepted:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:97
#: 4451423dcd72455a9e7e57f6d7d3f885
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{\"Fe\": [0, 0, 2.2], \"Cr\": [0, 0, -1.5]}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:101
#: e310ffa284244c2fad33d9118531ee1b
msgid "使用元素向量方向（use_element_dirs）"
msgstr "use_element_dirs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:103
#: 8d9a671fc2cf46d4ab1d41d0196b6a56
msgid "`bool`，默认 false，仅非共线 FM/AFM 使用。开启后，向量形式的元素条目会成为该元素的参考方向，AFM 再在这些方向上施加正负号。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false; used only by non-collinear FM/AFM. When enabled, vector-valued"
" element entries become the reference direction for each element, and AFM applies "
"positive or negative signs along those directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:105
#: d49a0480ce3d4f84bc5da5230196baad
msgid ""
"开启此项后，`MagFMnc` 表示所有原子使用 FM 正号分支，并不保证不同元素的向量彼此平行。普通 FM/AFM "
"数据准备建议保持关闭；需要自定义多元素方向时应仔细检查输出。"
msgstr ""
"When enabled, `MagFMnc` means that all atoms use the positive FM branch; it does not "
"guarantee parallel vectors across different elements. Keep it disabled for ordinary "
"FM/AFM data preparation and inspect outputs carefully when customizing multielement "
"directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:107
#: 9983eb4c8375408ea3008445b00b74c4
msgid "未列元素磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:109
#: 41cac059cda74b44ac511b8a0c91fbb8
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.0`。对作用范围内、但未出现在 `元素磁矩`（`magmom_map`）中的元素使用该非负磁矩幅值。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0`. Use this nonnegative moment magnitude for in-scope elements "
"absent from `Element moments` (`magmom_map`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:111
#: 52b8d7372f544d638c2f45fcc2afaa1e
msgid "仅作用于元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:113
#: 095c1887322a4caa9d340545cbf1253f
msgid "`str`，默认空。逗号分隔，例如 `Fe,Co`。非空时，只有列出的元素参与磁矩映射；其他元素磁矩为 0。留空时考虑全部元素。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default empty. Enter comma-separated elements such as `Fe,Co`. When nonempty, "
"only listed elements participate in moment mapping and all others have zero moments. "
"When empty, all elements are considered."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:115
#: 872adbb4177e4cc987e7ebb6c200e6c4
msgid ""
"执行顺序是：先按 `仅作用于元素`（`apply_elements`）选择元素，再从 `元素磁矩`（`magmom_map`）读取幅值，未命中时使用 "
"`未列元素磁矩`（`default_moment`）。如果最终没有任何非零磁矩，卡片明确失败，不生成带错误磁序标签的全零结构。"
msgstr ""
"The order is: select elements with `Apply only to elements` (`apply_elements`), read "
"magnitudes from `Element moments` (`magmom_map`), and use `Unlisted-element moment` "
"(`default_moment`) for misses. If no nonzero moments remain, the card fails "
"explicitly instead of generating an all-zero structure with a misleading magnetic-"
"order label."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:117
#: 6d6aa3c262f34b5ba0fa68eaec6073b1
msgid "输出分支"
msgstr "Output branches"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:119
#: dfc7a30ddf144571adbc9d9e52a3979c
msgid "生成 FM（gen_fm）"
msgstr "gen_fm"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:121
#: 9ae9080ae1c94053861025f74d9a554c
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。生成一个正号 FM 分支。"
msgstr "`bool`, default true. Generate one positive-sign FM branch."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:123
#: ac070eace8e6452b948e64ab0e2d79ee
msgid "生成 AFM（gen_afm）"
msgstr "gen_afm"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:125
#: 9ae9080ae1c94053861025f74d9a554c
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。开启后生成一个 AFM 分支，并显示 AFM 分配参数。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, generate one AFM branch and show AFM assignment "
"parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:127
#: e505f09565d44809b9995cb2373f84b8
msgid "生成随机 PM（gen_pm）"
msgstr "gen_pm"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:129
#: b19928e27578480a9f23f8f1e65a1283
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。开启后生成 `每个输入的 PM 数量`（`pm_count`）个随机 PM 初始态。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, generate `PM structures per input` (`pm_count`) "
"random PM initial states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:131
#: ad46910551d64ada851cac067ca4a3bf
msgid "FM、AFM 和 PM 至少要开启一个；全部关闭会明确失败。"
msgstr "At least one of FM, AFM, and PM must be enabled; disabling all three fails explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:133
#: 5afebe75119a4dcf961c22b449abf910
msgid "AFM 分配"
msgstr "AFM assignment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:135
#: 84ae9ecf2e3c43b18b9b481c57f715f9
msgid "AFM 分配方式（afm_mode）"
msgstr "afm_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:137
#: 55e7283df22e47cb9d69563156834896
msgid "`str`，默认 `k_vector`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `k_vector`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:139
#: 9fb22c32d3464112ad8983081fa226f7
msgid "`k_vector`：按当前晶胞的分数坐标层交替分配正负号。"
msgstr "`k_vector`: alternate signs by fractional-coordinate layers of the current cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:140
#: d6954a07e0d743eda5438bea6f47d60f
msgid "`group_ab`：读取已有的 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`，由两个标签指定正负号。"
msgstr ""
"`group_ab`: read the existing `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` and assign signs from two "
"labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:142
#: e3692cd093854c21841cda30a94d2179
msgid "旧值 `k-vector` 和 `group A/B` 会继续读取。group 模式缺少输入标签时不会再静默退回 k-vector。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy values `k-vector` and `group A/B` remain readable. If group mode lacks input "
"labels, it no longer silently falls back to k-vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:144
#: c8985f1fa857432684fa024c2cf0a2db
msgid "AFM 层向量（afm_kvec）"
msgstr "afm_kvec"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:146
#: 3b149b4b30eb4383b2e47c1d7cd4309f
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `111`，仅 `k_vector` 使用。可选 `100`、`010`、`001`、`110` 和 `111`，分别对应当前晶胞分数坐标中的 "
"a、b、c、a+b 和 a+b+c 相位方向。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `111`, used only by `k_vector`. Choose `100`, `010`, `001`, `110`, or "
"`111`, corresponding to phase directions a, b, c, a+b, and a+b+c in the current "
"cell's fractional coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:148
#: a09625c0c4244ca98a3d92a8f35f80e7
msgid "该规则依赖当前晶胞和坐标原点。若磁性原子只产生一种符号，卡片会要求扩胞或更换向量，而不是把 FM-like 结果标成 AFM。"
msgstr ""
"This rule depends on the current cell and coordinate origin. If magnetic atoms "
"produce only one sign, the card requires a larger cell or a different vector rather "
"than labeling the FM-like result as AFM."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:150
#: 40c8a4be09464dfc955edaefa5b2e49a
msgid "AFM 正号组（afm_group_a）"
msgstr "afm_group_a"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:152
#: 32941694ad484736aabf2da0bafdbdb4
msgid "`str`，默认 `A`，仅 `group_ab` 使用。必须非空，并在磁性原子中至少匹配一个输入 `group`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `A`, used only by `group_ab`. It must be nonempty and match at least "
"one input `group` among magnetic atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:154
#: e4d555c89890437980f91b62392d9351
msgid "AFM 负号组（afm_group_b）"
msgstr "afm_group_b"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:156
#: bada899898d64e879bf5cb046616c979
msgid "`str`，默认 `B`，仅 `group_ab` 使用。必须非空、与正号组不同，并在磁性原子中至少匹配一个输入 `group`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `B`, used only by `group_ab`. It must be nonempty, differ from the "
"positive-sign group, and match at least one input `group` among magnetic atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:158
#: 52ec7ffe2dde40559c7fe8e0c34efe50
msgid "其他分组置零（afm_zero_unknown）"
msgstr "afm_zero_unknown"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:160
#: 342ae009c36441bab8a5bd8e5c9732a3
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。开启时，不属于正号组或负号组的原子磁矩置零；关闭时，这些原子使用正号。该设置不会把 `group` 当成晶体学 `sublattice`。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. When enabled, atoms outside the positive- or negative-sign "
"groups receive zero moments; when disabled, they use the positive sign. This setting "
"does not interpret `group` as a crystallographic `sublattice`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:162
#: 06bc15af128e4f6b8f21e6330d7da814
msgid "随机 PM"
msgstr "Random PM"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:164
#: d9c0825aaf9a4a589e7071c07dddc660
msgid "每个输入的 PM 数量（pm_count）"
msgstr "pm_count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:166
#: 4728766cb5fa4d5b81b5ae3f6e29b641
msgid "`int`，默认 `10`，最小为 1。总输出数为已开启的 FM/AFM 分支数加 `每个输入的 PM 数量`（`pm_count`）。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `10`, minimum 1. Total outputs equal the enabled FM/AFM branches plus "
"`PM structures per input` (`pm_count`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:168
#: 63546ec2c264477f9cbf642041f7eea3
msgid "PM 方向分布（pm_direction）"
msgstr "pm_direction"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:170
#: 33cff0ff74e64d7dbda5a9665faf65c9
msgid "`str`，默认 `sphere`，仅非共线 PM 生效。"
msgstr "`str`, default `sphere`, used only for non-collinear PM."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:172
#: a30e918b67954e2696f7eb06a80aa8f0
msgid "`sphere`：整个球面均匀随机。"
msgstr "`sphere`: uniform random directions over the full sphere."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:173
#: 234e1231188c4aa1a5e53631d459a243
msgid "`cone`：参考轴周围的锥内随机。"
msgstr "`cone`: random directions within a cone around the reference axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:174
#: b0e288dc68294ee8a59297fa1090262a
msgid "`plane`：垂直于参考轴的平面内随机。"
msgstr "`plane`: random directions in the plane perpendicular to the reference axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:175
#: a52499fd092d40a88da66b6533a6c8b5
msgid "`参考轴`（`axis`）：沿参考轴随机取正负方向。"
msgstr ""
"`Reference axis` (`axis`): randomly choose the positive or negative reference-axis "
"direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:177
#: f91c2a657a064327a182148618aeed96
msgid "共线 PM 始终沿参考轴随机取正负号，不使用该参数。"
msgstr ""
"Collinear PM always chooses a random sign along the reference axis and does not use "
"this parameter."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:179
#: e464859d48934f8aa5d52eb987ae2924
msgid "PM 锥半角（pm_cone_angle）"
msgstr "pm_cone_angle"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:181
#: 5bd2239a50c44e6086eed0a4d613126a
msgid "`float`，默认 `30.0`，范围 0–180°，仅非共线 `cone` 使用。"
msgstr "`float`, default `30.0`, range 0–180°, used only by non-collinear `cone`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:183
#: 9d87ac1b3463421ba1f90e5b4590a2b5
msgid "按模长配对反向 PM（pm_balanced）"
msgstr "pm_balanced"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:185
#: 180230707dd54c7bb55254038adb465a
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。程序按相同磁矩模长分别生成反向方向对；完整配对会精确抵消，某一模长对应奇数个原子时可能留下一个残余磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. The program generates opposite-direction pairs for equal moment"
" magnitudes; complete pairs cancel exactly, while an odd number of atoms at one "
"magnitude may leave a residual moment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:187
#: 170d493b3e234101b81a404e8b8c3ff5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"在 `cone` 模式下，开启配对意味着方向分布在 $+\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ 和 $-\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ "
"两个锥内，而不是通过减均值破坏锥角限制。"
msgstr ""
"In `cone` mode, pairing distributes directions within cones around both "
"$+\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ and $-\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ rather than subtracting the mean and "
"violating the cone-angle limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:189
#: d37e6679838e4052b933ec7d31bfc405
msgid "随机性和输出预算"
msgstr "Randomness and output budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:191
#: 06c7e86465a54a3ba1b847ff90a75c2a
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:193
#: 06ff0f908fc648a7b5d20b359e934ccf
msgid "`bool`，默认 false，仅 PM 分支使用。开启后，seed、输入结构稳定标识和 PM 序号共同决定随机状态。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false, used only for PM branches. When enabled, the seed, stable "
"input-structure identifier, and PM index jointly determine the random state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:195
#: a0f219bdef314c03821ff73400d3919a
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:197
#: 33cff0ff74e64d7dbda5a9665faf65c9
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`，必须非负。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`, must be non-negative."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:199
#: 35f60af6f3384861be49d8d0cc896a6a
msgid "每个输入最大输出（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:201
#: baa6c0279abf4cd5b7b3e9fa52ce7187
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `100`，最小为 1。如果 FM、AFM 和 PM 的预计输出总数超过该值，卡片明确失败，防止误设 `每个输入的 PM "
"数量`（`pm_count`）后生成过量结构。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100`, minimum 1. If the estimated total FM, AFM, and PM outputs "
"exceed this value, the card fails explicitly to prevent an accidental excessive "
"output count from `PM structures per input` (`pm_count`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:203
#: 9912db69268e4a2f88d6124a14e26c70
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:205
#: e942a087b32049f28e1ced74de609922
msgid "FM 单端点"
msgstr "FM single endpoint"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:207
#: 6d16dd4aca7747e398acf78d7e508d93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"collinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2\",\n"
"    \"use_element_dirs\": false,\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_afm\": false,\n"
"    \"afm_mode\": \"k_vector\",\n"
"    \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": false,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 10,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": false,\n"
"    \"seed\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 100\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:237
#: 35969292c9e84085aca3dd27e97d78ab
msgid "FM + 分层 AFM + 共线 PM"
msgstr "FM + layered AFM + collinear PM"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:239
#: 6d16dd4aca7747e398acf78d7e508d93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"collinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2\",\n"
"    \"use_element_dirs\": false,\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_afm\": true,\n"
"    \"afm_mode\": \"k_vector\",\n"
"    \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": true,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 8,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 20\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:269
#: 6d3a716737164a49ba051ff49efd59cd
msgid "非共线球面 PM"
msgstr "Non-collinear spherical PM"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:271
#: 6d16dd4aca7747e398acf78d7e508d93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"noncollinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2,Co:1.7\",\n"
"    \"use_element_dirs\": false,\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe,Co\",\n"
"    \"gen_fm\": false,\n"
"    \"gen_afm\": false,\n"
"    \"afm_mode\": \"k_vector\",\n"
"    \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": true,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 16,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 7,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 20\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:301
#: 521c1ec1f5264d46bcac6b14fdda0849
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:303
#: 1c6e1947c3644c539e3034f468ea79ba
msgid "`Layer Groups` → `Magnetic Order`：先生成逐层交替的 A/B 标签，再用 `group_ab` 赋予 AFM 正负号。"
msgstr ""
"`Layer Groups` → `Magnetic Order`: first generate alternating A/B labels by layer, "
"then use `group_ab` to assign AFM signs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:304
#: 327d95db60b2499cafa336e79333dc73
msgid "`Magnetic Order` → `Moment Disorder`：先建立 FM/AFM 端点，再扫描局部无序比例。"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Moment Disorder`: establish FM/AFM endpoints first, then scan the"
" local disorder fraction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:305
#: 327d95db60b2499cafa336e79333dc73
msgid "`Magnetic Order` → `Local Magnetic Response`：在端点附近补充确定性小角响应。"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Local Magnetic Response`: add deterministic small-angle responses"
" around the endpoints."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:306
#: 327d95db60b2499cafa336e79333dc73
msgid "`Magnetic Order` → `SOC / Texture Response`：先建立参考磁态，再生成位置连续的有限 q 磁纹理。"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `SOC / Texture Response`: establish a reference magnetic state "
"before generating position-continuous finite-q textures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:308
#: 09d679c2d8c64489bb50ca62666fe6d1
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:310
#: b2c9c051f58f422f9f45ca12408dd817
msgid ""
"**预览提示没有非零磁矩。** `元素磁矩`（`magmom_map`）为空、磁矩都是 0，或 "
"`仅作用于元素`（`apply_elements`）排除了所有映射元素。卡片不会把全零自旋标成 FM/AFM/PM。"
msgstr ""
"**The preview reports no nonzero moments.** `Element moments` (`magmom_map`) is "
"empty, all moments are zero, or `Apply only to elements` (`apply_elements`) excludes "
"every mapped element. The card does not label an all-zero spin as FM/AFM/PM."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:312
#: 17152324969c4da8b2eb49b17d5f043d
msgid "**AFM 提示只有一个符号。** 当前晶胞在所选 k-vector 下没有足够的交替相位。先扩胞或更换 layer vector。"
msgstr ""
"**The AFM preview contains only one sign.** The current cell does not provide enough "
"alternating phases for the selected k-vector. Enlarge the cell or choose another "
"layer vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:314
#: 32672840e2924f45a18400a211249a8b
msgid ""
"**group 模式提示缺少 A/B。** 输入必须已有 "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`，且正负标签各自至少匹配一个非零磁矩原子。不会自动识别晶体学子晶格，也不会静默回退。"
msgstr ""
"**The group mode reports missing A/B groups.** The input must already contain "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`, and each sign label must match at least one atom with a "
"nonzero moment. The card does not infer crystallographic sublattices or silently fall"
" back."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:316
#: 13c015df189f4f78aea475c7be6bbe11
msgid "**配对后的 PM 净磁矩仍不完全为零。** 某种磁矩模长对应奇数个原子时会留下一个未配对方向；不同模长之间不会通过改变模长强行抵消。"
msgstr ""
"**The paired PM net moment is not exactly zero.** An odd number of atoms with a given"
" moment magnitude leaves one unpaired direction; different magnitudes are not "
"forcibly canceled by changing their sizes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:318
#: e28c233ae42f4a7da8847f02c283c5fa
msgid ""
"**PM 和 Moment Disorder 是否重复。** PM 分支把全部磁性原子直接放到一个随机端点；`Moment Disorder` "
"能按比例只改变部分已有磁矩并扫描中间无序度。"
msgstr ""
"**Are PM and Moment Disorder redundant?** A PM branch places all magnetic atoms "
"directly in one random endpoint, whereas `Moment Disorder` can alter only a selected "
"fraction of existing moments and scan intermediate disorder levels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:320
#: 6d6aa3c262f34b5ba0fa68eaec6073b1
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:322
#: 8f92b90cbad540a8af0410cd9bbfb7c7
msgid "`MagFM` / `MagFMnc`：共线 / 非共线 FM 正号分支。"
msgstr "`MagFM` / `MagFMnc`: collinear / non-collinear positive-sign FM branches."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:323
#: 8926761342aa466b9c173b42f8a7de46
msgid "`MagAFM111` / `MagAFM111nc`：按 k-vector 生成的 AFM。"
msgstr "`MagAFM111` / `MagAFM111nc`: AFM generated from a k-vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:324
#: 8926761342aa466b9c173b42f8a7de46
msgid "`MagAFMg` / `MagAFMgnc`：按现有 group 标签生成的 AFM。"
msgstr "`MagAFMg` / `MagAFMgnc`: AFM generated from existing group labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:325
#: 39c4b8a5d4e34414a00da8fa176554e2
msgid "`MagPM` / `MagPMnc`：随机 PM；固定 seed 时标签带派生 seed。"
msgstr ""
"`MagPM` / `MagPMnc`: random PM; with a fixed seed, the label includes the derived "
"seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:327
#: d6486e490f56431981170a52a0c69034
msgid "所有导出输出写入 `spin:R:3`。共线模式内部保留标量 `initial_magmoms`，导出时仍按参考轴转换为三分量 spin。"
msgstr ""
"All exported outputs write `spin:R:3`. Collinear mode keeps scalar `initial_magmoms` "
"internally, then converts it along the reference axis to three-component spin on "
"export."

